title: Interactive WGS-based CRAB outbreak investigation (EQA training exercise)
type: software
authors:
- given-names: Gültekin
  family-names: Ünal
  orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8996-7028
  affiliation: Ankara University, Faculty of Veterinary Medicine, Department of Microbiology
abstract: An interactive, browser-based walkthrough of a whole-genome-sequencing-based outbreak
  investigation of carbapenem-resistant Acinetobacter baumannii, built around the EURGen-RefLabCap
  2024 external quality assessment exercise. Intended as a teaching resource; the scenario
  is fictitious.
